ileyblackwell/mee_582-50.gif\" width=\"582\" height=\"50\" alt=\"Methods in Ecology and Evolution\"></a></font></b></p></td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img height=\"10\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/8PNZp-RQTkU3i-MwhQ7lrvdlvBvTo1bu7DzHo2QVbXiyp5j5X0KcoeBj7mG8fIzEPrbhuvf2M91wtGgYnt2JLg=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.wiley.co.uk/alertimages/spacer.gif\" width=\"20\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td align=\"left\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">\n\t\t<a href=\"http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p=10418042&amp;m=23132&amp;u=421746\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p%3D10418042%26m%3D23132%26u%3D421746&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237992372000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3b0E1FWYKgzhR60BFn8qbe\">\n\t\t<img border=\"0\" src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/4mgL4AoqKc-PwFAcSPCrfV0cfMH-e5H7JazBbXDS_H5rIFDAUzx_O40r37neniiw3Zj6LZNK3u-Wvk_s_FdM1yOaQpOoVmMxiW2453HPbULNqDjEMlJ1oeg=s0-d-e1-ft#http://download.interscience.wiley.com/jcovers/122652178/123243872.gif\" width=\"101\" height=\"131\" align=\"right\" hspace=\"10\" vspace=\"3\" alt=\"Methods in Ecology and Evolution\"></a><i>Methods \n\t\tin Ecology and Evolution (MEE)</i> publishes methodological papers in \n\t\tany area of ecology and evolution, including:</font><ul>\n\t\t\t<li><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">Phylogenetic analysis </font></li>\n\t\t\t<li><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">Statistical methods </font></li>\n\t\t\t<li><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">Conservation &amp; management </font>\n\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t<li><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">Theoretical methods </font></li>\n\t\t\t<li><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">Practical methods, including lab and \n\t\t\tfield </font></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t<p><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">This brand new journal, published by \n\t\tWiley-Blackwell on behalf of the British Ecological Society, has \n\t\tpublished nine articles online already. Read these papers for free \n\t\tonline:</font></p></td>\n\t</tr>\n</table>\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img height=\"6\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/8PNZp-RQTkU3i-MwhQ7lrvdlvBvTo1bu7DzHo2QVbXiyp5j5X0KcoeBj7mG8fIzEPrbhuvf2M91wtGgYnt2JLg=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.wiley.co.uk/alertimages/spacer.gif\" width=\"12\" border=\"0\"></td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td align=\"left\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"2\">\n\t\t<a href=\"http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p=10418042&amp;m=23132&amp;u=421747\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p%3D10418042%26m%3D23132%26u%3D421747&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237992372000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0cszzfyyKhm38UAOlTlfer\">\n\t\tUsing information criteria to select the correct variance–covariance \n\t\tstructure for longitudinal data in ecology</a><br>\n\t\t<i>Adrian G. Barnett, Nicola Koper, Annette J. Dobson, Fiona Schmiegelow, \n\t\tMicheline Manseau</i><br>\n\t\t<br>\n\t\t<a href=\"http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p=10418042&amp;m=23132&amp;u=421748\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p%3D10418042%26m%3D23132%26u%3D421748&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237992372000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0kVUfHcyjvttySrjw4jNnw\">\n\t\tAn empirical model for estimating aquatic invertebrate respiration</a><br>\n\t\t<i>Thomas Brey</i><br>\n\t\t<br>\n\t\t<a href=\"http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p=10418042&amp;m=23132&amp;u=421749\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p%3D10418042%26m%3D23132%26u%3D421749&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237992372000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zqBlhb38xeewJcfSUNkZ9\">\n\t\tParameter landscapes unveil the bias in allometric prediction</a><br>\n\t\t<i>Cang Hui, John S. Terblanche, Steven L. Chown, Melodie A. McGeoch</i><br>\n\t\t<br>\n\t\t<a href=\"http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p=10418042&amp;m=23132&amp;u=421750\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p%3D10418042%26m%3D23132%26u%3D421750&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237992372000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3XzW5YcZf-exHzZsaJdhH_\">\n\t\tA versatile telemetry system for continuous measurement of heart rate, \n\t\tbody temperature and locomotor activity in free-ranging ruminants</a><br>\n\t\t<i>Claudio Signer, Thomas Ruf, Franz Schober, Gerhard Fluch, Thomas \n\t\tPaumann, Walter Arnold</i><br>\n\t\t<br>\n\t\t<a href=\"http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p=10418042&amp;m=23132&amp;u=421751\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p%3D10418042%26m%3D23132%26u%3D421751&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237992372000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-1P4ADBvgvzf953PJT-aW\">\n\t\tA novel approach to detecting a regime shift in a lake ecosystem</a><br>\n\t\t<i>Gideon Gal, William Anderson</i><br>\n\t\t<br>\n\t\t<a href=\"http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p=10418042&amp;m=23132&amp;u=421752\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p%3D10418042%26m%3D23132%26u%3D421752&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237992372000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ERCwJZzOxH3lXRhPc7_F9\">\n\t\tA simplified method for monitoring progestagens in African elephants \n\t\tunder field conditions</a><br>\n\t\t<i>Elizabeth W. Freeman, F. Nicole Abbondanza, Jordana M. Meyer, Bruce \n\t\tA. Schulte, Janine L. Brown</i><br>\n\t\t<br>\n\t\t<a href=\"http://dmmsclick.wileyeurope.com/click.asp?p=10418042&amp;m=23132&amp;u=421753\" target=\"_blank\" rel